t card companies are doing the  exact same thing but it's not just  capping the interest rates here they  support Medicare for all they support a  $15 minimum wage they support getting  money out of politics and overturning  Citizens United  they support taking action on climate  change they support renewable energy  they support debt free or free college  they support all of these things that  have been trashed as far left socialist  ideas now to throw a wrench in the works  there's another poll from Gallup that  says that only 40% of Americans say that  socialism would be good for the United  States fifty-one percent say that it  would be bad but the flaw with this  Gallup poll is that it's straight up  just asking people with socialism be a  good thing or a bad thing for the United  States once you start breaking that down  into individual policies that might be  socialism but if you just say hey what  about Medicare fraud do you support that  guess what  overwhelming majority of everybody says  yes I do I think that's a good idea even  if you mentioned afterwards that well  isn't that kind of socialism they'll say  oh well I guess it is but I like it  same thing with Social Security which  also by the way a majority of all  parties support expanding Social  Security we we have socialism in place  in the United States today already  so this Gallup poll that says only 40  percent think it would be a good thing  yeah when you ask a misleading question  when you ask about a word which is  socialism that most people honest to god  couldn't even define then yeah they're  probably gonna say it's bad but once you  start breaking it down into individual  policies once you divorce those policies  from a politician or political party  support for them goes up other polls  have proven that when you attach it to a  political party the support does drop a  little not a ton but it does drop a  little but it shows you that the  American public is hungry for  policy and more importantly they're  hungry for policies that most  Republicans and even some centrist  Democrats would absolutely classify as  socialism we have to take a quick break  we'll be right back with more on the  David Pakman show
 

